ing:16px 20px;width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#888;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;font-weight:600;\">Sua funcao</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0 0;color:#1B2C5E;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\">{{ $json.body.role }}</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 40px;\"><p style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">Clique no botao abaixo para criar sua senha e comecar a usar o sistema. O convite expira em <strong>7 dias</strong>.</p><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;\"><a href=\"{{ $json.body.inviteLink }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8BC53F,#6BA02F);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:15px 48px;border-radius:12px;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(139,197,63,0.3);\">Aceitar Convite e Criar Conta</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:28px 40px 40px;\"><p style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;\">Se o botao nao funcionar, copie e cole este link no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ $json.body.inviteLink }}\" style=\"color:#8BC53F;word-break:break-all;font-size:11px;\">{{ $json.body.inviteLink }}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background:#f5f7fa;padding:24px 40px;border-top:1px solid #eee;\"><p style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:10px;margin:0;\">Poxpur Sales Hub &copy; 2026 - Email automatico</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
